flowchart TB
    U["Client / SDK"] --> API["EvalHub API + tenant authorization<br/>trusted provider / benchmark dispatch"]
    API -->|ordinary benchmark| JOB["Existing Kubernetes Job + sidecar<br/>tenant namespace, no sandbox compute"]
    API -->|sandbox required| REC["SandboxedEvaluation + TrustyAI reconciler<br/>durable lifecycle, status and finalizer"]
    subgraph P["Trusted platform module: gateway, identity, policy, lifecycle, recovery"]
        PS["Platform sandbox service<br/>tenant workspace, templates, credential and provider bindings, job identity"]
        IDP["OIDC issuer / token broker<br/>required audience, stable subject, array role claim"]
        GW["OpenShell gateway + Kubernetes driver<br/>authenticated TLS and workspace RBAC"]
        ADM["Sandbox namespace guardrails and admission<br/>profile, ownership, quota, policy, storage, Kueue"]
        ASC["Agent Sandbox controller<br/>only it and the driver administer the namespace"]
        LC["Sandbox lifecycle controller and TTL sweeper<br/>expiry, orphan records, bounded retry"]
        PS -->|obtain automation and job identity| IDP
        GW -->|validate audience and role claims| IDP
        PS -->|workspace, templates, bindings and primary creation| GW
        GW -->|validate effective requests| ADM
        GW -->|Sandbox CR per create| ASC
    end
    REC --> PS
    subgraph T["Trusted per-job services: outside evaluated code"]
        BR["Compatibility broker<br/>Kubernetes subset to OpenShell<br/>job-scoped capability, tenant workspace"]
        REL["Integration relay<br/>job-bound callbacks, credentials and results"]
    end
    PS -.->|issue workspace membership and job capability| BR
    BR -->|child and streaming operations| GW
    subgraph W["Installation-wide sandbox namespace shared by every consumer of the gateway<br/>shared mode: one workspace per EvalHub tenant, {workspace}--{name}"]
        SUP["Trusted OpenShell supervisors<br/>policy and credential mediation"]
        PRI["Untrusted job sandbox<br/>one primary per evaluation job"]
        CH["Untrusted child sandboxes<br/>bounded fan-out and lifetime<br/>provider-gated, pending open question"]
        RES["Guardrails for the shared namespace<br/>SCC / PSA, quota and network<br/>short-lived PVCs with verified reclamation"]
        NS["One workspace per tenant, no namespace or workspace per sandbox<br/>sandboxes isolated from each other<br/>gateway-generated unique names"]
        SUP <-->|authenticated sandbox protocol| PRI
        SUP <-->|authenticated sandbox protocol| CH
        PRI --- RES
        CH --- RES
    end
    ASC -->|supervisor Pod| SUP
    ASC -->|workload Pod| PRI
    ASC -->|workload Pod| CH
    LC -->|TTL expiry and abandoned-resource reconciliation| GW
    ADM -.->|qualified once, enforced per sandbox| RES
    PS -.->|bind only the job's broker capability| PRI
    PRI -->|job-authenticated requests| BR
    PRI -->|scoped events and artifacts| REL
    SUP -->|approved endpoint-bound requests| EXT["Model, judge and data endpoints"]
    REL --> STORE[("Tenant results / MLflow / OCI<br/>EvalHub callbacks")]
    classDef trusted fill:#edf3f7,stroke:#3d586b,color:#132c3b
    classDef untrusted fill:#fff3df,stroke:#8d6429,color:#453213
    classDef external fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#7a7a7a,color:#333333
    classDef annotation fill:#ffffff,stroke:#8a8a8a,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#333333
    class PS,IDP,GW,ADM,ASC,LC,BR,REL,SUP,RES,JOB trusted
    class API,REC trusted
    class PRI,CH untrusted
    class U,EXT,STORE external
    class NS annotation
    style P fill:#f4f8fb,stroke:#3d586b,color:#132c3b
    style T fill:#f4f8fb,stroke:#3d586b,color:#132c3b
    style W fill:#fbfbfb,stroke:#6b6b6b,color:#333333
